p;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Farticles%2Fauditory%2F&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Auditory%20Disabilities%20-%20Introduction&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=301195456.1774685902&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/articles.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Auditory Disabilities<br><span class=\"subtitle\">Introduction</span></h1>\n\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span class=\"hidden\">You are here: </span><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &gt; <a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a> &gt; Auditory Disabilities</p>\n\n<nav role=\"navigation\">\n<h2>Article Contents</h2>\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li class=\"currentpage\"><span class=\"hidden\">Current page: </span>Page 1: Introduction</li>\n\t\t<li>Page 2: <a href=\"auditorydisabilities\">Types of Auditory Disabilities</a></li>\n\t\t<li>Page 3: <a href=\"culture\">Deaf Culture </a></li>\n\t</ol>\n</nav>\n\n<div class=\"callout\">\n\t<div class=\"title\">WebAIM Training</div>\n\t<p>WebAIM offers a variety of trainings to educate and empower you to build and maintain accessible web content.</p>\n\t<p class=\"calloutlink\"><a href=\"/services/training\">Learn more about WebAIM training</a>\n</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"something\">\n\t<h2>Something to Think About...</h2>\n\n\t<p><span class=\"inlinemediaobject floatright\"><img src=\"media/ear.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"138\"></span>When we think of accessibility, we often envision a blind user using a screen reader. Users who are deaf or hard-of-hearing are easily overlooked. With video and multimedia content so prevalent online, it's important that users with auditory disabilities be considered.</p>\n\n\t<h2>Solutions</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>The most important consideration to make content accessible to users with hearing impairment is very straightforward - provide <a href=\"/techniques/captions/\">captions</a> for multimedia content (meaning video content that also has audio) and provide <a href=\"/techniques/captions/#transcripts\">transcripts</a> for all audio content. A sign language version of the media may also be provided for an even more inclusive experience (assuming visitors understand the version of sign language provided).</p>\n\t\n\t<p>Additionally, many users with hearing loss possess some degree of hearing and may prefer audio content\u2014on its own or in conjunction with captions. Reasonable effort should be taken to create high quality audio and to eliminate unnecessary background noise.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"nextpage\"><a href=\"auditorydisabilities\">Next</a></div>\n\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t<div id=\"updated\">Last updated: <time datetime=\"2020-09-25\">Sep 25, 2020</time></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"translations\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Translations</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"http://www.magendarmgrippe.net/hoerbehinderung/\"><img src=\"/media/common/flags/de.png\" alt=\"\">German</a> by Magen Darm Grippe</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://mertsahinoglu.com/webaim-isitsel-engelliler/\"><img src=\"/media/common/flags/tr.png\" alt=\"\">Turkish</a> by <a href=\"http://mertsahinoglu.com/\">Mert Sahinoglu</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/techniques/captions/\">Web Captioning Overview</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/pour/\">Constructing a POUR Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/visual/\">Visual Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/motor/\">Motor Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/cognitive/\">Cognitive Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/seizure/\">Seizure and Vestibular Disorders</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">\u00a92026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\